    excerpt: 'Air vs sea freight, per-country customs duty rates, de minimis thresholds, HS code selection, incoterms explained, common shipping mistakes new hijab buyers make, and how to actually calculate landed cost.',
    metaTitle: 'Shipping Hijabs Internationally: The Buyer\'s Guide',
